{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25968","headline":"悼豆卢策先辈 · 鲍溶","name":"悼豆卢策先辈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丧车出东门，生时马无力。\n何处入黄泉，嵩高山西北。\n室人万里外，久望君官职。\n今与牵衣儿，翻号死消息。\n平生江海上，我不空相识。\n远客迷畏途，孤鸿伤一翼。\n行将鸡黍祭，已是乌鸢食。\n劝酒执御郎，行人有哀色。\n先悲三尺土，经岁哭不得。\n眼前双双流，故袂安可拭。\n一拜隔千里，生人意何极。\n唯有阳春曲，永播清玉德。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25968.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25968","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}